&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord has a highly engaged community of millions of daily active users who use the platform for many different reasons, but there’s one thing that nearly everyone does: &lt;strong&gt;play video games.&lt;/strong&gt; Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming, and we are focused on making it easier and more fun for people to hang out before, during, and after playing games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord has a highly engaged community of millions of daily active users who use the platform for many different reasons, but there&#39;s one thing that nearly everyone does: play video games. Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming, and we are focused on making it easier and more fun for people to hang out before, during, and after playing games.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a new role, on a new team. The Brand Team sits alongside Design Systems in Design Foundations and keeps Discord&#39;s identity, voice, and visual system consistent across every surface where the brand appears. We run the brand like an internal product: we set its strategy, build and maintain its guidelines and tools, enable other teams to use it on their own, and review brand-facing work across product, marketing, partnerships, and legal. Marketing is a client of Brand: we equip their work with a brand that stays clear and current, while campaigns, ads, and launch messaging stay theirs to run.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re a brand designer with gaming in your bones who can set the vision and do the work. You think in systems: logo, color, type, iconography, illustration, and motion are parts of one identity, and you know how to write the rules that keep it coherent when hundreds of people use it. You&#39;re as comfortable presenting brand architecture to executives as you are refining a wordmark. You&#39;re a generous partner who grounds every decision in reasoning rather than taste, and you&#39;d rather teach a team to use the brand well than gatekeep it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This person will report to the Director of Product Design, Design Foundations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defining Discord&#39;s brand strategy: positioning, brand architecture across the master brand and sub-brands like Nitro (Discord&#39;s premium subscription), and the narrative of what Discord stands for and for whom&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning and evolving Discord&#39;s visual identity system, including logo, wordmark, color, typography, iconography, illustration, and motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building and maintaining brand and sub-brand guidelines, including standards for co-branding, partnerships, and third-party integrations, and partnering with Voice &amp;amp; Tone and User Communications to bring the Voice &amp;amp; Writing Guide into the brand system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building templates, design kits, asset libraries, and a self-serve brand portal, and enabling teams to use the brand on their own through office hours, a support channel, onboarding, and workshops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviewing and approving brand-facing work across marketing, product, and partnerships, and working with Legal on trademark and usage policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applying the brand directly on core surfaces, including app icons, deck templates, the marketing site design system, office spaces, signage, and merch, and art-directing the external partners who help produce them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Running an annual brand audit across every surface, monitoring the competitive landscape, and mentoring future Brand team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in brand or identity design, including owning a brand system at scale for a gaming or games-adjacent brand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio with exemplary craft across identity, typography, color, iconography, illustration, and motion, applied across digital product, marketing, and physical spaces, with your role on each project clearly shown&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of brand strategy work, including positioning, brand architecture, and sub-brand systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing brand guidelines and governance models and running them over time: maintaining them, holding teams accountable to them, and evolving them as they&#39;re tested in real use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity: you&#39;ve built a brand practice where there was no playbook, and you&#39;re willing to do the hands-on work while setting direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated ability to align stakeholders at every level, from executives to individual designers, with clear reasoning and strong presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience using AI tools and agents in brand work, and a clear point of view on where AI helps craft and where it doesn&#39;t&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience standing up a brand function, brand portal, or DAM (digital asset management system) from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with co-branding and partnership governance, or trademark and usage compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working alongside a design systems team, including Figma libraries and variables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Discord?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We&#39;re a multiplatform, multigenerational and multiplayer platform that helps people deepen their friendships around games and shared interests, and helps developers build and grow their businesses. We believe games give us a way to have fun with our favorite people, whether listening to music together or grinding in competitive matches for diamond rank. &lt;strong&gt;Join us in our mission! Your future is just a click away!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
